 begin="01:38.330" end="01:38.600">waited </span><span begin="01:38.600" end="01:39.797">awake  </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.500" end="01:43.360"><span begin="01:39.500" end="01:40.220">It's </span><span begin="01:40.220" end="01:40.600">time </span><span begin="01:40.600" end="01:41.300">to </span><span begin="01:41.300" end="01:41.890">roll </span><span begin="01:41.890" end="01:43.355">over </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.060" end="01:47.040"><span begin="01:43.060" end="01:44.060">I </span><span begin="01:44.060" end="01:44.730">feel </span><span begin="01:44.730" end="01:45.760">no </span><span begin="01:45.760" end="01:47.034">sympathy </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.740" end="01:50.570"><span begin="01:46.740" end="01:47.590">You </span><span begin="01:47.590" end="01:48.480">lived </span><span begin="01:48.480" end="01:49.200">inside </span><span begin="01:49.200" end="01:49.710">a </span><span begin="01:49.710" end="01:50.565">cave </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.270" end="01:53.850"><span begin="01:50.270" end="01:51.020">You </span><span begin="01:51.020" end="01:51.410">barely </span><span begin="01:51.410" end="01:51.770">get </span><span begin="01:51.770" end="01:52.150">by </span><span begin="01:52.150" end="01:52.440">the </span><span begin="01:52.440" end="01:52.810">rest </span><span begin="01:52.810" end="01:53.250">of </span><span begin="01:53.250" end="01:53.848">us </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.550" end="01:55.680"><span begin="01:53.550" end="01:54.120">You're </span><span begin="01:54.120" end="01:54.350">trying  </span><span begin="01:54.350" end="01:54.580">there's </span><span begin="01:54.580" end="01:54.800">no </span><span begin="01:54.800" end="01:55.030">need </span><span begin="01:55.030" end="01:55.400">to </span><span begin="01:55.400" end="01:55.677">apologize </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.380" end="01:59.670"><span begin="01:55.380" end="01:56.180">I've </span><sp